## stk2 crash reports
user_data/

## Build data
binaries/
target/
debug/

## Prebuilt 3rd-party libraries (staged from vostok-libs by `vostok tool libs`;
## mirrors the shipped game's binaries.prebuilt/ layout - blobs, not source)
binaries.prebuilt/

# rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

## Binary blobs (prebuilt libs, build outputs) live ONLY under binaries/ and
## binaries.prebuilt/ (both ignored above). We deliberately do NOT ignore
## *.lib/*.exe/*.pdb/*.dll globally: ignoring by type hides the bug instead of
## the artifact - a binary that appears anywhere else is a misplacement we WANT
## to surface in `git status`, not silence.

# Claude Code local state (keep shared agents + commands, ignore the rest)
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/

# Python
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Windows Installer files (toolchain build outputs)
*.cab
*.msi
*.msix
*.msm
*.msp

